hat life isn’t a parade of amusements. More important, it spawns creativity and self-sufficiency.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/02/02/opinion/sunday/children-bored.html', 'snippet': 'Boredom teaches us that life isn’t a parade of amusements. More important, it spawns creativity and self-sufficiency.', 'lead_paragraph': '“I’m bored.” It’s a puny little phrase, yet it has the power to fill parents with a cascade of dread, annoyance and guilt. If someone around here is bored, someone else must have failed to enlighten or enrich or divert. And how can anyone — child or adult — claim boredom when there’s so much that can and should be done? Immediately.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/03/opinion/sunday/03paul/03paul-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 631, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/02/03/opinion/sunday/03paul/03paul-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 631}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/03/opinion/sunday/03paul/03paul-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 974, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/03/opinion/sunday/03paul/03paul-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2032, 'width': 1931, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/03/opinion/sunday/03paul/03paul-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/02/03/opinion/sunday/03paul/03paul-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}