le/76511753-c89d-551f-9604-094ee2a0212d'}, {'abstract': 'With its efficient design and reusable stainless-steel filter, you might want to skip the coffee shop.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/02/04/dining/pour-over-coffee-maker.html', 'snippet': 'With its efficient design and reusable stainless-steel filter, you might want to skip the coffee shop.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The efficient design of this pour-over coffee maker caught the eye of the people who buy goods for the Museum of Modern Art’s shop. With a handle that stays cool, the glass coffee-brewing and serving carafe holds 34 ounces and comes with a reusable stainless-steel filter and a fat cork stopper. It’s all you need to get your coffee fix from morning to dinner party. The pitcher and filter are dishwasher-safe. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/06/dining/06burner7/06burner7-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 711, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/02/06/dining/06burner7/06burner7-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 711}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/06/dining/06burner7/06burner7-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 865, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/06/dining/06burner7/06burner7-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1729, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/06/dining/06burner7/06burner7-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 