rl': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/02/05/opinion/marie-colvin-syria-assad-court-judgment.html', 'snippet': 'A federal court orders Syria’s government to pay the American journalist’s family $302.5 million for what the judge called her deliberate killing.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A war correspondent of extraordinary courage, Marie Colvin knew the danger she faced. She had reported from such places as Iraq, Chechnya, East Timor, Sierra Leone and Sri Lanka, where she lost an eye to a government-fired rocket-propelled grenade. Her last war, the Syrian Army’s bombardment of rebels in Homs, she told a friend, was “the worst we’ve ever seen.” But it was not a stray round that killed her and a French photojournalist, Rémi Ochlik, there in February 2012.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/06/opinion/04sergeWeb/merlin_150188055_a54d294f-fae2-40ac-a196-4c102e6d1fc2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 402, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/02/06/opinion/04sergeWeb/merlin_150188055_a54d294f-fae2-40ac-a196-4c102e6d1fc2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 402}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/06/opinion/04sergeWeb/merlin_150188055_a54d294f-fae2-40ac-a196-4c102e6d1fc2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 685, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/06/opinion/04sergeWeb/merlin_150188055_a54d294f-fae2-40ac-a196-4c102e6d1fc2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1371, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/06/opinion/0