, 'uri': 'nyt://article/de5dd223-f990-5aaf-b3d9-7b8c886ad263'}, {'abstract': 'Bob Dylan, whose first formal concert Mr. Young produced, called his Greenwich Village shop, the Folklore Center, “the citadel of Americana folk music.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/02/05/obituaries/izzy-young-dead.html', 'snippet': 'Bob Dylan, whose first formal concert Mr. Young produced, called his Greenwich Village shop, the Folklore Center, “the citadel of Americana folk music.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Izzy Young, whose Greenwich Village shop, the Folklore Center, was the beating heart of the midcentury folk music revival — and who in 1961 presented the first New York concert by a young Bob Dylan — died on Monday at his home in Stockholm. He was 90.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/06/obituaries/06YOUNG2/merlin_150226695_4ea29440-c784-4ae3-9534-d3cd54ab564e-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 890, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/02/06/obituaries/06YOUNG2/merlin_150226695_4ea29440-c784-4ae3-9534-d3cd54ab564e-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 890}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/06/obituaries/06YOUNG2/merlin_150226695_4ea29440-c784-4ae3-9534-d3cd54ab564e-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 691, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/06/obituaries/06YOUNG2/merlin_150226695_4ea29440-c784-4ae3-9534-d3cd54ab564e-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1382, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/06/obitu