ck of diversity and heal a rift between the generations while remaining prime-time entertainment. It’s a tall order it hasn’t fulfilled yet.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/02/06/arts/music/grammy-awards-preview.html', 'snippet': 'Music’s big awards show is trying to remedy its lack of diversity and heal a rift between the generations while remaining prime-time entertainment. It’s a tall order it hasn’t fulfilled yet.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Year after year, I have dutifully watched the Grammy Awards. And the next morning, year after year, I have wondered why.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '25', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/10/nyregion/10grammy-promo/merlin_150428073_61aa83f7-35dd-4d44-8ef4-95e9b0206b75-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/02/10/nyregion/10grammy-promo/merlin_150428073_61aa83f7-35dd-4d44-8ef4-95e9b0206b75-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/10/nyregion/10grammy-promo/merlin_150428073_61aa83f7-35dd-4d44-8ef4-95e9b0206b75-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 680, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/10/nyregion/10grammy-promo/merlin_150428073_61aa83f7-35dd-4d44-8ef4-95e9b0206b75-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1360, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/10/nyregion/10grammy-promo/merlin_150428073_61aa83f7-35dd-4d44-8ef4-95e9b0206b75-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'th