higan district for a record 59 years, he was one of the last of a group of powerful Democratic committee chairmen on Capitol Hill.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/02/07/us/politics/john-dingell-dead-longest-congressman.html', 'snippet': 'Representing a Michigan district for a record 59 years, he was one of the last of a group of powerful Democratic committee chairmen on Capitol Hill.', 'lead_paragraph': 'John D. Dingell Jr., a powerful and tenacious Michigan Democrat who pushed landmark legislation, exposed corruption in government and became the longest-serving member of Congress in American history, died on Thursday at his home in Dearborn, Mich. He was 92.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/09/obituaries/09dingell-print1/merlin_82487306_200ba09d-631e-43b5-b682-b855bb2eec6d-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 425, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/02/09/obituaries/09dingell-print1/merlin_82487306_200ba09d-631e-43b5-b682-b855bb2eec6d-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 425}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/09/obituaries/09dingell-print1/merlin_82487306_200ba09d-631e-43b5-b682-b855bb2eec6d-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 725, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/09/obituaries/09dingell-print1/merlin_82487306_200ba09d-631e-43b5-b682-b855bb2eec6d-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1449, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/09/obituaries/09dingell-print1/dingell6-thumbStandard.