2023a4213a'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Bezos published a deeply personal blog post on Thursday accusing The National Enquirer of trying to blackmail him with explicit pictures.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/02/07/business/bezos-blog.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Bezos published a deeply personal blog post on Thursday accusing The National Enquirer of trying to blackmail him with explicit pictures.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jeff Bezos, the chief executive of Amazon and the richest man in the world, published an extraordinarily personal blog post on Thursday that accused the owner of The National Enquirer of trying to blackmail him in order to stop an investigation into how the tabloid had obtained private messages and pictures sent between him and the woman he was seeing.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/09/business/09Bezos-enquirercover-silo/08Bezos-enquirercover-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 644, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/02/09/business/09Bezos-enquirercover-silo/08Bezos-enquirercover-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 644}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/09/business/09Bezos-enquirercover-silo/08Bezos-enquirercover-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 955, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/09/business/09Bezos-enquirercover-silo/08Bezos-enquirercover-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1909, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/09/business/09Bezos-enquirercover-silo/08Bezos-enquirercover-thumbStandard.jpg