ount': 872, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9199eec8-3ead-5c03-a9c9-368bb4736352'}, {'abstract': 'The White House physician made a long-term prognosis about President Trump’s health without issuing a detailed final report about what a team of specialists treating him found.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/02/08/us/politics/trump-health-physical.html', 'snippet': 'The White House physician made a long-term prognosis about President Trump’s health without issuing a detailed final report about what a team of specialists treating him found.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — President Trump’s personal physician said on Friday that the president is in “very good health” and should remain so “for the remainder of his presidency and beyond” after Mr. Trump underwent a comprehensive physical examination at Walter Reed National Military Medical Center outside Washington.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/09/us/politics/09dc-trumpmed/merlin_150365505_b4b571a5-87fb-4774-93c1-6f683ba0c15d-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/02/09/us/politics/09dc-trumpmed/merlin_150365505_b4b571a5-87fb-4774-93c1-6f683ba0c15d-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/09/us/politics/09dc-trumpmed/merlin_150365505_b4b571a5-87fb-4774-93c1-6f683ba0c15d-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/09/us/politics/09dc-trumpmed/merlin_150365505_b4b571a5-87fb-4774-93c1-6f683ba0c15d-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name':