t cut off), Brandi Carlile provided a thrill and Alicia Keys brought the chill. From powerhouse performances to mismatched collaborations, here’s how we saw the show.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/02/11/arts/music/grammys-moments-best-worst.html', 'snippet': 'Drake showed up (and got cut off), Brandi Carlile provided a thrill and Alicia Keys brought the chill. From powerhouse performances to mismatched collaborations, here’s how we saw the show.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The 61st annual Grammy Awards on Sunday worked to right the wrongs of the past few years’ ceremonies, where the leading narrative was tension over a lack of diversity and poor representation for the most influential young artists in music. Big stars still stayed home — and one of the biggest got cut off mid-speech — but the show corralled a former first lady and delivered many messages of inspirational uplift. Here are the highlights and lowlights as we saw them:', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/12/arts/12grammys-bestworst-13/merlin_150515388_d3e43cb0-aa4d-41ac-b9bc-f23215772839-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 449, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/02/12/arts/12grammys-bestworst-13/merlin_150515388_d3e43cb0-aa4d-41ac-b9bc-f23215772839-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 449}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/12/arts/12grammys-bestworst-13/merlin_150515388_d3e43cb0-aa4d-41ac-b9bc-f23215772839-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 767, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/12/arts/12grammys-bestworst-13/merlin_150515388_d3e43cb0-aa4d-41ac-b9bc-f23215772839-s