schouler-helmut-lang-fashion-review.html', 'snippet': 'Proenza Schouler invents a garment, Helmut Lang returns (again) and the search for newness goes on.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Monday afternoon, as hundreds of pet owners gathered in the familiar confines of Madison Square Garden for the Westminster Dog Show, Proenza Schouler lured the fashion crowd to the 22nd floor of an unfinished building in the newly gentrified kennel of Hudson Yards on the Far West Side of Manhattan — the steel and glass urban oasis aiming to change the gravitational poles of the city — to show them where the big Labradoodles were going to play.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/12/12REVIEW-preoenza-SUB/merlin_150549528_c60f2c6a-d5c4-4e58-acf3-64ac26443e8f-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 750, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/02/12/12REVIEW-preoenza-SUB/merlin_150549528_c60f2c6a-d5c4-4e58-acf3-64ac26443e8f-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 750}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/12/12REVIEW-preoenza-SUB/merlin_150549528_c60f2c6a-d5c4-4e58-acf3-64ac26443e8f-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 820, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/12/12REVIEW-preoenza-SUB/merlin_150549528_c60f2c6a-d5c4-4e58-acf3-64ac26443e8f-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1639, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/12/12REVIEW-preoenza-SUB/12REVIEW-preoenza-SUB-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop