d women and nonwhite artists, the Recording Academy tried something else: the opposite.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Last year (and plenty of years before that), the Grammys were deeply unfortunate. The show paid mere lip service to the successes of women and nonwhite performers, and were boring to boot. So the bar for this year’s ceremony, which took place Sunday at the Staples Center in Los Angeles, was low, and the remit was clear: do everything the opposite of how it has been done.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/12/arts/12grammys-bestworst-7/merlin_150508410_3554a50c-d56a-413c-841d-422ecee9cdcd-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/02/12/arts/12grammys-bestworst-7/merlin_150508410_3554a50c-d56a-413c-841d-422ecee9cdcd-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/12/arts/12grammys-bestworst-7/merlin_150508410_3554a50c-d56a-413c-841d-422ecee9cdcd-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/12/arts/12grammys-bestworst-7/merlin_150508410_3554a50c-d56a-413c-841d-422ecee9cdcd-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/12/arts/12grammys-bestworst-7/12grammys-bestworst-7-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/02/12/arts/12grammys-bestworst-7/12grammys-bestworst-7-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thu