ience.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/02/12/books/ta-nehisi-coates-water-dancer-calida-garcia-rawles.html', 'snippet': '“The Water Dancer,” out in September, is about an enslaved man whose life is altered by a near-death experience.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ta-Nehisi Coates’s first novel, “The Water Dancer,” will be published in September by One World, an imprint of Random House, and now, it has a cover. The image, painted by the artist Calida Garcia Rawles, depicts a black man submerged in water, a reflection of both a plot point in the book as well as Rawles’ previous work, in which she said she’s combined the “meditative” quality of water to reckon with black trauma.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/14/books/14arts1-print/13COATES-ITEM1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 912, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/02/14/books/14arts1-print/13COATES-ITEM1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 912}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/14/books/14arts1-print/13COATES-ITEM1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 674, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/14/books/14arts1-print/13COATES-ITEM1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1900, 'width': 1250, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/14/books/14arts1-print/13COATES-ITEM1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/02/14/books/14arts1-print/13COATES-ITEM1-thumbStandard