'lastname': 'Nossiter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/66430a24-38a7-5395-914e-5f1fadba7b18', 'word_count': 1204, 'uri': 'nyt://article/66430a24-38a7-5395-914e-5f1fadba7b18'}, {'abstract': 'Pete Wells extols a breakfast treat on a bialy at Shelsky’s Brooklyn Bagels.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/02/12/dining/pork-roll-egg-and-cheese-bialy-shelskys-brooklyn.html', 'snippet': 'Pete Wells extols a breakfast treat on a bialy at Shelsky’s Brooklyn Bagels.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It is a safe guess that the Eastern European Jews who brought the bialy from Bialystok to New York City, piecing back together the recipe for this plain but beguiling dimpled roll in their new world after fleeing their old one, did not do it so that one day it could be sliced open and stuffed with a New Jersey pork sausage that comes in a cloth sack.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/13/dining/13bialy2/merlin_150157125_70e32873-594d-4e80-aa94-b1c13cfaca58-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/02/13/dining/13bialy2/merlin_150157125_70e32873-594d-4e80-aa94-b1c13cfaca58-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/13/dining/13bialy2/merlin_150157125_70e32873-594d-4e80-aa94-b1c13cfaca58-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/13/dining/13bialy2/merlin_150157125_70e32873-594d-4e80-aa94-b1c13cfaca58-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 136