': 'Rachel Weisz Is the Passion Pick, Online and on Awards Shows', 'kicker': 'The Carpetbagger', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Rachel Weisz, Passion Pick, At the Prizes And Online', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ACTORS AND ACTRESSES', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Weisz, Rachel', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'The Favourite (Movie)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Disobedience (Movie)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Academy Awards (Oscars)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-02-13T17:36:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kyle Buchanan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kyle', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Buchanan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3090050a-9dc2-58b4-b00b-f672632fc482', 'word_count': 1179, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3090050a-9dc2-58b4-b00b-f672632fc482'}, {'abstract': 'Studying diaries, letters and more, she found that women, in the South and beyond, were not just passive observers of the vital events of their time.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/02/13/obituaries/anne-firor-scott-dead.html', 'snippet': 'Studying diaries, letters and more, she found that women, in the South and beyond, were not just passive observers of the vital events of their time.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Anne Firor Scott, a scholar who brought a new prominence to women’s history and taught generations of Duke University students how to study and appreciate it, died on Feb. 5 at her home in Chapel Hill, N.C. She was 97.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 's