/us/chicago-exonerations-drug-sentences.html', 'snippet': 'The arrests of two law enforcement officers in 2012 brought attention to the tactics used in a public housing complex.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In 2012, a Chicago police sergeant and an officer were arrested in an undercover operation for stealing $5,200 from a person carrying what they thought was cash for drug dealers. The officers eventually entered plea deals, but the arrests led to scrutiny of the tactics they and their team had used while making drug arrests at the Ida B. Wells housing complex on Chicago’s South Side for years.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/14/us/14xp-chicago/merlin_150638046_9c079acf-07c0-4053-b6df-8209108863f7-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 359, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/02/14/us/14xp-chicago/merlin_150638046_9c079acf-07c0-4053-b6df-8209108863f7-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 359}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/14/us/14xp-chicago/merlin_150638046_9c079acf-07c0-4053-b6df-8209108863f7-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 614, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/14/us/14xp-chicago/merlin_150638046_9c079acf-07c0-4053-b6df-8209108863f7-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1227, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/14/us/14xp-chicago/14xp-chicago-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/02/14/us/14xp-chicago/14xp-chicago-thumbStandard.jpg'