b14-5722-895d-c44cf678ad72'}, {'abstract': 'The daughter of Gui Minhai, a Swedish bookseller detained in China, said the ambassador arranged a meeting with men who first offered to help, then cajoled and pressured her.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/02/14/world/europe/gui-minhai-sweden-china.html', 'snippet': 'The daughter of Gui Minhai, a Swedish bookseller detained in China, said the ambassador arranged a meeting with men who first offered to help, then cajoled and pressured her.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BEIJING — Sweden said it was investigating its ambassador to China after she was accused of arranging unauthorized, secret talks between the daughter of a Swedish bookseller detained in China and two Chinese men who had offered to help free him, but instead pressured her to keep silent.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/15/world/15china-sweden-print/merlin_105197564_a195a52d-47a0-4c45-9ec0-311fc64bb9f3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/02/15/world/15china-sweden-print/merlin_105197564_a195a52d-47a0-4c45-9ec0-311fc64bb9f3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/15/world/15china-sweden-print/merlin_105197564_a195a52d-47a0-4c45-9ec0-311fc64bb9f3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/15/world/15china-sweden-print/merlin_105197564_a195a52d-47a0-4c45-9ec0-311fc64bb9f3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail