d9'}, {'abstract': 'The chief justice faces a time of great testing, both of himself and of the institution he heads, as the lower courts move rapidly even to his right.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/02/14/opinion/abortion-supreme-court-louisiana.html', 'snippet': 'The chief justice faces a time of great testing, both of himself and of the institution he heads, as the lower courts move rapidly even to his right.', 'lead_paragraph': 'No, I wasn’t surprised last week, as most people apparently were, when Chief Justice John Roberts cast the deciding fifth vote to preserve access to abortion in Louisiana for at least a little while longer. In fact, I had predicted it (and I have witnesses).', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/14/opinion/14greenhouseWeb/14greenhouseWeb-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 381, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/02/14/opinion/14greenhouseWeb/14greenhouseWeb-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 381}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/14/opinion/14greenhouseWeb/14greenhouseWeb-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 650, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/14/opinion/14greenhouseWeb/14greenhouseWeb-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1300, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/14/opinion/14greenhouseWeb/14greenhouseWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/02/14/opinion/14greenhouseWeb/14greenhouseWeb-th