tive/1e5a3f06-7f77-5ee3-9832-cab645c4fc9d'}, {'abstract': 'The caddie, David Giral Ortiz, initially received $5,000 when Kuchar won $1.296 million at the Mayakoba Classic in November. A typical caddie fee would have been about $130,000, or 10 percent of the winnings.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/02/15/sports/golf/matt-kuchar-caddie-check.html', 'snippet': 'The caddie, David Giral Ortiz, initially received $5,000 when Kuchar won $1.296 million at the Mayakoba Classic in November. A typical caddie fee would have been about $130,000, or 10 percent of the winnings.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LOS ANGELES — Matt Kuchar had heard enough. Battered by criticism that he had essentially stiffed a caddie who helped him win a tournament last November in Mexico, he took action to make amends on Friday, issuing a statement in which he apologized for his initial actions and also said he had now paid the caddie a good deal more money.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/16/sports/15golf-caddie/merlin_146590671_29e8342a-2670-42de-9f05-d8a411057662-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 371, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/02/16/sports/15golf-caddie/merlin_146590671_29e8342a-2670-42de-9f05-d8a411057662-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 371}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/16/sports/15golf-caddie/merlin_146590671_29e8342a-2670-42de-9f05-d8a411057662-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 633, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/16/sports/15golf-caddie/merlin_146590671_29e8342a-2670-42de-9f05-d8a411057662-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1266, 'width':