 promos for “Yesterday,” “Chlid’s Play” and “Ma” stood out; the one for “Aladdin” raised eyebrows.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s hard to pick this week’s scariest trailer. Was it one of the terrifying clips for the horror flicks “Child’s Play” and “Ma”? Or Will Smith’s disturbingly blue genie in “Aladdin”? Here’s the rundown, ranked from most to least horrifying.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/16/movies/16trailers-week1/16trailers-week1-articleLarge.png', 'height': 247, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/02/16/movies/16trailers-week1/16trailers-week1-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 247}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/16/movies/16trailers-week1/16trailers-week1-jumbo.png', 'height': 421, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/16/movies/16trailers-week1/16trailers-week1-superJumbo.png', 'height': 524, 'width': 1274, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/16/movies/16trailers-week1/16trailers-week1-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/02/16/movies/16trailers-week1/16trailers-week1-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/16/movies/16trailers-week1/16trailers-week1-thumbLarge.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline