 one of the biggest and oldest investment firms in Russia, was detained on Friday along with five other.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MOSCOW — The American founder of one of the oldest and largest Russia-focused private equity firms was detained on fraud charges in Moscow on Friday in a case that jolted the country’s business community.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/16/us/16russia-investor-1/merlin_150743400_6c0f6f18-fe8e-42f0-bf71-c48c3a8047a4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 375, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/02/16/us/16russia-investor-1/merlin_150743400_6c0f6f18-fe8e-42f0-bf71-c48c3a8047a4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 375}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/16/us/16russia-investor-1/merlin_150743400_6c0f6f18-fe8e-42f0-bf71-c48c3a8047a4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 640, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/16/us/16russia-investor-1/merlin_150743400_6c0f6f18-fe8e-42f0-bf71-c48c3a8047a4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1281, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/16/us/16russia-investor-1/merlin_150743400_6c0f6f18-fe8e-42f0-bf71-c48c3a8047a4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/02/16/us/16russia-investor-1/merlin_150743400_6c0f6f18-fe8e-42f0-bf71-c48c3a8047a4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': No