l': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/02/15/opinion/sunday/instagram-story-breakup.html', 'snippet': 'A social media guide for the newly single.', 'lead_paragraph': "Ending a relationship is hard, but telling mutual friends and loved ones you've split can be even harder. Fortunately, the people at Instagram Stories have your back. They've provided a foolproof method for the romantically bereaved to broadcast the message “I am really going through a breakup” without ever having to say “We just wanted different things” to an acquaintance on the street. If you're too nervous and/or cowardly to tell your wider social circle and a boss from three jobs ago that you recently broke up with your partner, just post one or two of these stories. They will know.", 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/17/opinion/sunday/17heisey1/merlin_150712233_20c181c3-dabb-4452-a1e2-d8b305f619f3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 977, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/02/17/opinion/sunday/17heisey1/merlin_150712233_20c181c3-dabb-4452-a1e2-d8b305f619f3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 977}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/17/opinion/sunday/17heisey1/merlin_150712233_20c181c3-dabb-4452-a1e2-d8b305f619f3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 630, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/17/opinion/sunday/17heisey1/merlin_150712233_20c181c3-dabb-4452-a1e2-d8b305f619f3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1259, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 