', 'value': 'Measles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Vaccination and Immunization', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Epidemics', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Oregon', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Washington (State)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Portland (Ore)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Pacific Northwestern States (US)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-02-17T00:20:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kirk Johnson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kirk', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Johnson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b7751994-f1a7-544e-b113-9eaf8fdde2fa', 'word_count': 1008, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b7751994-f1a7-544e-b113-9eaf8fdde2fa'}, {'abstract': '“Listen, I was stubborn,’’ he said on Saturday. one day after making amends with a caddie he initially shortchanged after winning a tournament.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/02/16/sports/matt-kuchar-caddie-ortiz-pay.html', 'snippet': '“Listen, I was stubborn,’’ he said on Saturday. one day after making amends with a caddie he initially shortchanged after winning a tournament.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LOS ANGELES — Matt Kuchar said Saturday that the golden rule in his family is pretty simple and that it goes like this: “In any situation if you can just understand where somebody else is coming from, it makes the world a whole lot better of a place.”', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/16/sports/16golf1/merlin_150778347_892aa03d-9c6b-4d74-9d25-4d151d368ee8-articleLarge.