817, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2d88649f-ea36-5379-98d0-b1a9a3a9734a'}, {'abstract': 'The social renaissance is happening from the ground up.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/02/18/opinion/culture-compassion.html', 'snippet': 'The social renaissance is happening from the ground up.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I start with the pain. A couple times a week I give a speech somewhere in the country about social isolation and social fragmentation. Very often a parent comes up to me afterward and says, “My daughter took her life when she was 14.” Or, “My son died of an overdose when he was 20.” ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/18/opinion/18brooksSub/merlin_141879903_5271bb71-70bb-407d-8c01-95a7f74cee6f-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/02/18/opinion/18brooksSub/merlin_141879903_5271bb71-70bb-407d-8c01-95a7f74cee6f-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/18/opinion/18brooksSub/merlin_141879903_5271bb71-70bb-407d-8c01-95a7f74cee6f-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/18/opinion/18brooksSub/merlin_141879903_5271bb71-70bb-407d-8c01-95a7f74cee6f-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/18/opinion/18brooksSub/18brooksSub-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'image