eed to know to start the day: Get New York Today in your inbox.]', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/20/nyregion/20advocate5/00advocate5-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/02/20/nyregion/20advocate5/00advocate5-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/20/nyregion/20advocate5/00advocate5-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/20/nyregion/20advocate5/00advocate5-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 914, 'width': 1370, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/20/nyregion/20advocate5/00advocate5-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/02/20/nyregion/20advocate5/00advocate5-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/20/nyregion/20advocate5/00advocate5-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Can a Republican Win a Citywide Race in N.Y.? Maybe, With Amazon’s Help', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'He Cheered On the Amazon Deal. Now That’s His Political Wedge.', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ulrich, Eric A', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections, Public Advocate', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AMAZON.COM INC', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tax Credits, Deductions and Exemptions', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Democratic Party', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Blake, Michael A (1982- )', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kim, Ronald (1979- )', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Long Island City (Queens, NY)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-02-19T10:00:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeffery C. Mays and William Neuman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeffery', 'middlename': 'C.', 'lastname': 'Mays', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'William', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Neuman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e4f3cad8-76bd-5aed-9f3e-88c69ed453d7', 'word_count': 1326, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e4f3cad8-76bd-5aed-9f3e-88c69ed453d7'}, {'abstract': 'Mecox Bay Dairy offers a wide range of cow’s milk cheeses, from a Stilton-style blue to an aged, firm Alpine style.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/02/19/dining/mecox-bay-dairy-hamptons.html', 'snippet': 'Mecox Bay Dairy offers a wide range of cow’s milk cheeses, from a Stilton-style blue to an aged, firm Alpine style.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Despite gridlocked traffic and huge houses, the East End of Long Island is still farm country, as it has been for centuries, with fields of corn, seasonal produce stands and, more recently, wineries. But cheesemakers are in short supply, so the fine cheeses that Art Ludlow and his sons, Peter and John,  produce at Mecox Bay Dairy are all the more precious. The assorted cheeses are all made with raw milk from Jersey cows. Of particular note are Atlantic Mist, a soft-ripening Camembert-style that becomes creamier as it matures, and Mecox Sunrise, an assertive washed-rind cheese, with a firm but satiny texture and some sweetness in the aftertaste. Other Mecox cheeses include Cheddar, ricotta, a Stilton-style blue and Sigit, an aged Alpine cheese from an area without a mountain in sight. Some are now sold  online.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/20/dining/20burner2/20burner2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 402, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/02/20/dining/20burner2/20burner2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 402}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/20/dining/20burner2/20burner2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 686, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/20/dining/20burner2/20burner2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1372, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/20/dining/20burner2/20burner2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/02/20/dining/20burner2/20burner2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtyp