s. Now they must confront a post-Lagerfeld future at a time of heightened flux in the global luxury market.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/02/19/fashion/karl-lagerfeld-chanel-fendi.html', 'snippet': 'The designer dominated the creative side of two of fashion’s best-known names for decades. Now they must confront a post-Lagerfeld future at a time of heightened flux in the global luxury market.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Karl Lagerfeld’s death leaves a void atop two of fashion’s biggest names, Chanel and Fendi, and signals a potentially seismic shift on the industry’s creative side at a time of heightened flux in the global luxury market.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '25', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/19/business/19LAGERFELDSUCCESSION-01/merlin_150881268_f5ea8860-2615-4d4b-b4d2-a66a001a30d2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/02/19/business/19LAGERFELDSUCCESSION-01/merlin_150881268_f5ea8860-2615-4d4b-b4d2-a66a001a30d2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/19/business/19LAGERFELDSUCCESSION-01/merlin_150881268_f5ea8860-2615-4d4b-b4d2-a66a001a30d2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/19/business/19LAGERFELDSUCCESSION-01/merlin_150881268_f5ea8860-2615-4d4b-b4d2-a66a001a30d2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/19/business/19LAGERFELDSUCCESSION-01/merlin_150881268