intour, Anna', 'rank': 14, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'de la Fressange, Ines', 'rank': 15, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-02-19T22:42:42+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'T Magazine', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Slideshow', '_id': 'nyt://slideshow/b9e5ae5d-ca40-520d-80d4-a2cee186c79f', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://slideshow/b9e5ae5d-ca40-520d-80d4-a2cee186c79f'}, {'abstract': 'The late Chanel designer’s peers — including Florence Welch, Carine Roitfeld and Donatella Versace — reflect on his wit, generosity and boundless talent.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/02/19/t-magazine/remembering-karl-lagerfeld.html', 'snippet': 'The late Chanel designer’s peers — including Florence Welch, Carine Roitfeld and Donatella Versace — reflect on his wit, generosity and boundless talent.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Karl Lagerfeld, who died Tuesday, was a rare and powerful constant in the notoriously changeable fashion world. During his 36-year tenure at Chanel, where he became the creative director in 1983, he solidified the conventions of modern ready-to-wear — with its round-the-year collections, high-low mix and celebrity affiliations — and established the French luxury house as a multibillion-dollar global empire. He also forged his own unchanging persona as fashion’s erudite emperor, always dressed in a high-collared white shirt with a powdered ponytail and possessed of equally mythic foibles, such as his limitless devotion to his cat Choupette and his collection of 300 iPods. While Lagerfeld held positions at multiple houses during his career, including Chloé and Fendi, he became what Andrew O’Hagan described in a 2015 cover profile for T as “a freelance personality with a strong conception of himself that exists beyond the labels he represents.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/19/t-magazine/19tmag-karl-slide-P1QY/19tmag-karl-slide-P1QY-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/02/19/t-magazine/19tmag-karl-slide-P1QY/19tmag-karl-slide-P1QY-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/19/t-magazine/19tmag-karl-slide-P1QY/19tmag-karl-slide-P1QY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/19/t-magazine/19tmag-karl-slide-P1QY/19tmag-karl-slide-P1QY-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/19/t-magazine/19tmag-karl-slide-P1QY/19tmag-karl-slide-P1QY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/02/19/t-magazine/19tmag-karl-slide-P1QY/19tmag-karl-slide-P1QY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/19/t-magazine/19tmag-karl-slide-P1QY/19tmag-karl-slide-P1QY-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Karl Lagerfeld, Remembered by His Friends and Collaborators', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Models (Professional)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'