ame': 'glocations', 'value': 'North Carolina', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Midterm Elections (2018)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections, House of Representatives', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dowless, L McCrae Jr', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Absentee Voting', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Frauds and Swindling', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Harris, Mark (1966- )', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McCready, Dan', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Democratic Party', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'BLADEN COUNTY (NC)', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-02-21T00:33:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alan Blinder', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Blinder', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/17f998df-6762-517c-b32d-3a8987deb796', 'word_count': 1373, 'uri': 'nyt://article/17f998df-6762-517c-b32d-3a8987deb796'}, {'abstract': 'From the beach to the supermarket to the apocalypse, Karl Lagerfeld aimed to amaze.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/02/20/fashion/lagerfeld-sets-fashion-week.html', 'snippet': 'From the beach to the supermarket to the apocalypse, Karl Lagerfeld aimed to amaze.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Even during the Great Recession, Karl Lagerfeld spent liberally on his sets for Chanel shows at each Paris fashion week. There was the iceberg, a 28-foot frozen mountain purportedly hacked from a glacier, hauled to France from Sweden in 15 tractor-trailers and then trucked back again. There was the supermarket, a fake food hall complete with Chanel-labeled products, which was ransacked by guests (and at which, Joan Smalls pushed Cara Delevingne and Rihanna in a cart). There was the staged protest; a manufactured beach, complete with swelling waters; and a giant bouclé jacket sculpture, in the most literal homage to the Chanel’s storied brand. And who could forget the rocket ship that actually took off?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/19/fashion/20lagerfeld-sub-slideshow-slide-IYX0/20lagerfeld-sub-slideshow-slide-IYX0-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/02/19/fashion/20lagerfeld-sub-slideshow-slide-IYX0/20lagerfeld-sub-slideshow-slide-IYX0-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/19/fashion/20lagerfeld-sub-slideshow-slide-IYX0/20lagerfeld-sub-slideshow-slide-IYX0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/19/fashion/20lagerfeld-sub-slideshow-slide-IYX0/20lagerfeld-sub-slideshow-slide-IYX0-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/19/fashion/20lagerfeld-sub-slideshow-slide-IYX0/20lagerfeld-sub-slideshow-slide-IYX0-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/02/19/fashion/20lagerfeld-sub-slideshow-slide-IYX0/20lagerfeld-sub-slideshow-slide-IYX0-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'th