d-e2b2-548c-81c3-d83fb230406a'}, {'abstract': 'An author who knew his subject firsthand from his years as an official in Communist Poland, he became a sought-after voice on Soviet affairs.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/02/21/obituaries/seweryn-bialer-dead.html', 'snippet': 'An author who knew his subject firsthand from his years as an official in Communist Poland, he became a sought-after voice on Soviet affairs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Seweryn Bialer, who endured persecution by the Nazis in Poland and served in its postwar Communist government before defecting to the West and becoming a leading expert on the Soviet Union, died on Feb. 8 at his home in Manhattan. He was 92.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/27/obituaries/22BIALER1/merlin_151002726_7091d8d0-bcd6-428b-bdd1-d857bf0dcabd-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 896, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/02/27/obituaries/22BIALER1/merlin_151002726_7091d8d0-bcd6-428b-bdd1-d857bf0dcabd-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 896}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/27/obituaries/22BIALER1/merlin_151002726_7091d8d0-bcd6-428b-bdd1-d857bf0dcabd-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 686, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/27/obituaries/22BIALER1/merlin_151002726_7091d8d0-bcd6-428b-bdd1-d857bf0dcabd-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1372, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/27/obituaries/22BIALER1/22BIALER1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height':