 be a prince actually did come from one of Belgium’s grandest families.', 'lead_paragraph': '[FROM OUR SPECIAL CORRESPONDENT.] BRUSSELS, Feb. 24 — A great sensation has been caused here by the reports in the French papers to the effect that a man passing himself off as Prince Looz Corswaren had swindled several guileless French people out of about one million francs, on the strength of his alleged approaching marriage, first at Nice, then in Paris, and lastly in London, with an immensely wealthy lady, Princess Demidoff of San Donato.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/25/world/europe/25ihtretrospective-image/25ihtretrospective-image-jumbo.png', 'height': 352, 'width': 363, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/25/world/europe/25ihtretrospective-image/25ihtretrospective-image-superJumbo.png', 'height': 352, 'width': 363, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/25/world/europe/25ihtretrospective-image/25ihtretrospective-image-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/02/25/world/europe/25ihtretrospective-image/25ihtretrospective-image-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/25/world/europe/25ihtretrospective-image/25ihtretrospective-image-thumbLarge.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '1894: A Conman Passing Himself Off as a Belgian Prince Is Authentic', 'kicker': None, 'conte