 Bausch-like and Bausch-lite.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/02/25/arts/dance/pina-bausch-tanztheater-wuppertal.html', 'snippet': 'In London, Tanztheater Wuppertal performs two new pieces — the first non-Bausch works in 45 years — that are both Bausch-like and Bausch-lite.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — A woman slides slowly down a slatted foam mountain and out of her long chiffon dress, emerging naked, perhaps new born, at the bottom. Another woman sprouts multiple legs that dance gaily as she smiles beatifically. Long metal tubes are threaded through a man’s sleeves; bells are hung from another’s genitals; arrows are pierced through bodies.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/26/arts/26bausch-notebook1/merlin_151242681_d738ffa3-7aa0-436e-8f85-398e3d496ee2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 863, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/02/26/arts/26bausch-notebook1/merlin_151242681_d738ffa3-7aa0-436e-8f85-398e3d496ee2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 863}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/26/arts/26bausch-notebook1/merlin_151242681_d738ffa3-7aa0-436e-8f85-398e3d496ee2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 712, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/26/arts/26bausch-notebook1/merlin_151242681_d738ffa3-7aa0-436e-8f85-398e3d496ee2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1424, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/26/arts/26bausch-notebook1/26bausch-notebook1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'wi