to move forward, though he says no amount of money can replace what he lost by being wrongfully convicted of killing his ex-girlfriend and her son in 1978.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/02/25/us/craig-coley-simi-valley.html', 'snippet': 'The man, Craig Coley, now 71, plans to move forward, though he says no amount of money can replace what he lost by being wrongfully convicted of killing his ex-girlfriend and her son in 1978.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Craig Coley was never a wealthy man. There was a time, before he was wrongfully convicted of murder and spent nearly four decades in prison, when he juggled multiple jobs to afford a home. Those days now seem far away.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/26/arts/26xp-coley-print/merlin_133951731_b15bea26-e53e-4e86-8edc-97e3fc7a7065-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 447, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/02/26/arts/26xp-coley-print/merlin_133951731_b15bea26-e53e-4e86-8edc-97e3fc7a7065-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 447}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/26/arts/26xp-coley-print/merlin_133951731_b15bea26-e53e-4e86-8edc-97e3fc7a7065-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 762, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/26/arts/26xp-coley-print/merlin_133951731_b15bea26-e53e-4e86-8edc-97e3fc7a7065-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1525, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/26/arts/26xp-coley-print/26xp-coley-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75,