ect', 'value': 'Evangelical Movement', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Cuba', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-02-25T22:14:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Americas', 'byline': {'original': 'By Elisabeth Malkin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Elisabeth', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Malkin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e4ec6f5f-c538-518a-8f37-6ec2fbb24104', 'word_count': 1526, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e4ec6f5f-c538-518a-8f37-6ec2fbb24104'}, {'abstract': 'Chelsea Market Basket now carries Lakrids, from a small-batch producer in Denmark.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/02/25/dining/lakrids-danish-licorice.html', 'snippet': 'Chelsea Market Basket now carries Lakrids, from a small-batch producer in Denmark.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Licorice is a favorite flavor in Scandinavian countries; unless you belong to the cohort that cannot bear it, you should keep it in mind as you explore Nordic cuisines. In Denmark, the confectioner Johan Bulow has achieved some renown for his Lakrids. His products start with fresh licorice root that he sweetens and seasons with chocolate, sea salt, coffee, passion fruit, chiles or the juices of currants, cranberries, strawberries or cherries. The little spheres burst with flavor.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/27/dining/27BurnerLicor-1/merlin_150281085_55db78a1-fc98-40ba-b7c2-49bf01a5a16b-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/02/27/dining/27BurnerLicor-1/merlin_150281085_55db78a1-fc98-40ba-b7c2-49bf01a5a16b-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/27/dining/27BurnerLicor-1/merlin_150281085_55db78a1-fc98-40ba-b7c2-49bf01a5a16b-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/27/dining/27BurnerLicor-1/merlin_150281085_55db78a1-fc98-40ba-b7c2-49bf01a5a16b-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/27/dining/27BurnerLicor-1/27BurnerLicor-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/02/27/dining/27BurnerLicor-1/27BurnerLicor-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/27/dining/27BurnerLicor-1/27BurnerLicor-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Danish Licorice Ready to Entice', 'kicker': 'Front Burner', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'To Savor: Get a Pop of Flavor Via Danish Licorice', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Candy', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Lakrids by Bulow A/S', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Chelsea Market Baskets', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-02-25T22:15:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Florence Fabricant', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Florence', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fabricant', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6602c711-8c38-5d3c-9933-3a9ff867a7e9', 'word_count': 129, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6602c711-8c38-5d3c-9933-3a9ff867a7e9'}, {'abstract': 'Boris Fishman recalls his youth in Belarus in this page-turner with recipes.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/02/25/dining/boris-fishman-savage-feast.html', 'snippet': 'Boris Fishman recalls his youth in Belarus in this page-turner with recipes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The book “Savage Feast,” by Boris Fishman, has descriptions of meals and food throughout, along with 25 recipes. But it’s not a cookbook. The book is a tightly written page-turner about the author’s childhood in Minsk, his extended family and their odyssey from Belarus to New York (via Vienna and Rome in the 1980s) as well as his efforts to conquer his own demons. While reading it, I was frequently tempted to head to the kitchen and fry some onions, the step that starts many of the Eastern European recipes in his book, especially those attributed to an aunt and notably to Oksana, a Ukranian woman and a magical cook who was his grandfather’s companion in Brooklyn. Dishes like braised cabbage, potato latkes and sweet-and-sour roasted peppers are some of the recipes.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/27/dining/27BurnerBook-1/merlin_150234552_ba97a16b-a79a-432a-9201-0f151fe9f812-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 821, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/02/27/dining/27BurnerBook-1/merlin_150234552_ba97a16b-a79a-432a-9201-0f151fe9f812-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 821}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/27/dining/27BurnerBook-1/merlin_150234552_ba97a16b-a79a-432a-9201-0f151fe9f812-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 749, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/27/dining/27BurnerBook-1/merlin_150234552_ba97a16b-a79a-432a-9201-0f151fe9f812-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1498, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/27/dining/27BurnerBook-1/27BurnerBook-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/02/27/dining/27BurnerBook-1/27BurnerBook-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/27/dining/27BurnerBook-1/27BurnerBook-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Memoir to Whet the Appetite', 'kicker': 'Front Burner', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'To Discover: Whetting the Appetite With a Memoir', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fishman, Boris', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Savage Feast: Three Generations, Two Continents, and Dinner Table (A Memoir with Recipes) (Book)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-02-25T22:20:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Florence Fabricant', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Florence', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fabricant', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/61cdf34e-7244-59df-adcb-f2ccb6c1e4e6', 'word_count': 176, 'uri': 'nyt://article/61cdf34e-7244-59df-adcb-f2ccb6c1e4e6'}, {'abstract': 'Fords Gin Officers’ Reserve is a higher alcohol-content spirit made in the style of British Navy gin.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/02/25/dining/drinks/fords-gin-officers-reserve.html', 'snippet': 'Fords Gin Officers’ Reserve is a higher alcohol-content spirit made in the style of British Navy gin.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Navy-strength describes a category of gin that’s overproof, that is, more than the standard 40 percent alcohol for most spirits (and sometimes more than 50 percent). “But why Navy?” you may ask as you sip your gin and tonic. In the British Navy, the shipboard gin supplies traditionally included casks, usually from sherry-making, that held high-proof gin reserved for officers. If gin (or rum) could ignite gunpowder, it gave “proof” that it was not diluted, and had to be at least 57 percent alcohol. Simon Ford, who makes Fords Gin, has now introduced his Officers’ Reserve, a Navy-strength gin at 54.5 percent alcohol. Like Fords Gin, it’s London-style, dry and infused with classic botanicals and spices, like juniper, which impart subtle flavor. The alcohol gives it heat, which can be tempered with ice and a splash of lime and good tonic water. It does well in a martini, with a little more than a soupçon of vermouth.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/27/dining/27BurnerGin-1/merlin_151067655_9f912626-ef64-408f-9ab1-3209bdd29b9d-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 506, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/02/27/dining/27BurnerGin-1/merlin_151067655_9f912626-ef64-408f-9ab1-3209bdd29b9d-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 506}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/27/dining/27BurnerGin-1/merlin_151067655_9f912626-ef64-408f-9ab1-3209bdd29b9d-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 864, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/27/dining/27BurnerGin-1/merlin_151067655_9f912626-ef64-408f-9ab1-3209bdd29b9d-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1728, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/27/dining/27BurnerGin-1/27BurnerGin-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/02/27/dining/27BurnerGin-1/27BurnerGin-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/27/dining/27BurnerGin-1/27BurnerGin-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Overproofed Gin for Your Martini', 'kicker': 'Front Burner', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'To Sip: Overproof Gin For Your Martini', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gin (Liquor)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ALCOHOLIC BEVERAGES', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-02-25T22:23:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'subsection_name': 'Wine, Beer & Cocktails', 'byline': {'original': 'By Florence Fabricant', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Florence', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fabricant', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9248fdb7-56e1-5fe5-88b4-246b4da7f356', 'word_count': 193, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9248fdb7-56e1-5fe5-88b4-246b4da7f356'}, {'abstract': 'When you need a new charging cable for your phone, or video cable for your TV, you don’t need to spend a fortune. We asked the experts for the affordable options they buy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/02/25/smarter-living/the-discount-cable-and-charger-brands-you-can-trust.html', 'snippet': 'When you need a new charging cable for your phone, or video cable for your TV, you don’t need to spend a fortune. We asked the experts for the affordable options they buy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The future isn’t as wireless as we were promised. Whether you’re looking for a second charger for your phone or need a new video cable for your home theater, you need cords you can trust.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/26/smarter-living/26sl-discountcables-web/26sl-discountcables-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/02/26/smarter-living/26sl-discountcables-web/26sl-discountcables-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/26/smarter-living/26sl-discountcables-web/26sl-discountcables-web-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/26/smarter-living/26sl-discountcables-web/26sl-discountcables-web-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, 