nk': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United States Soccer Federation', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-02-26T21:21:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Das', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Das', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d6dc46dc-52d7-59b1-aa88-6996bc563170', 'word_count': 827, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d6dc46dc-52d7-59b1-aa88-6996bc563170'}, {'abstract': 'Modern Love in miniature, featuring reader-submitted stories of no more than 100 words. For this issue, we sought stories from our Australian readers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/02/26/style/tiny-modern-love-stories.html', 'snippet': 'Modern Love in miniature, featuring reader-submitted stories of no more than 100 words. For this issue, we sought stories from our Australian readers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On holiday in America, I became pen pals with a guy who loves Aussie wildlife. Back in Sydney, I told my 85-year-old grandmother I wanted to send him photos of native birds. Weeks later, I received a voice mail message from her, saying, “I took my first photo! It’s a cockatoo for you to send to that boy you like in New York.” It was blurry, and his response wasn’t game-changing, but I’ll always remember that my grandmother learned how to use an iPhone just so she could help me impress a bloke overseas. The ultimate wingwoman. — Hayley Noble', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/01/28/fashion/xxtinylove-promo-three5/xxtinylove-promo-three5-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/01/28/fashion/xxtinylove-promo-three5/xxtinylove-promo-three5-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/01/28/fashion/xxtinylove-promo-three5/xxtinylove-promo-three5-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/01/28/fashion/xxtinylove-promo-three5/xxtinylove-promo-three5-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 954, 'width': 1431, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/01/28/fashion/xxtinylove-promo-three5/xxtinylove-promo-three5-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/01/28/fashion/xxtinylove-promo-three5/xxtinylove-promo-three5-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/01/28/fashion/xxtinylove-promo-three5/xxtinylove-promo-three5-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Tiny Love Stories: Australia Edition', 'kicker': 'MODERN LOVE', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Love (Emotion)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Modern Love (Times Column)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dating and Relationships', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Australia', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Sydney (Australia)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-02-26T21:28:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f3e817d9-c350-5946-b7c8-9fc769b1ed2d', 'word_count': 595, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f3e817d9-c350-5946-b7c8-9fc769b1ed2d'}, {'abstract': 'Shana S. Decree, 45, and her daughter Dominique K. Decree, 19, face charges of criminal homicide and conspiracy in the deaths of their relatives, including three children.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/02/26/us/mother-daughter-kill-children-family.html', 'snippet': 'Shana S. Decree, 45, and her daughter Dominique K. Decree, 19, face charges of criminal homicide and conspiracy in the deaths of their relatives, including three children.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There was nothing amiss when a social worker visited the family in Apartment S7 in Morrisville, Pa., on Feb. 5. When she went back to the unit on Monday for a wellness check on the eight family members who lived there, no one answered her knock on the door, and a maintenance worker called the police, according to a criminal affidavit.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/27/us/27xp-homicide-1-print/merlin_151287327_910379bc-a027-42ab-b1c6-6545f308bd42-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/02/27/us/27xp-homicide-1-print/merlin_151287327_910379bc-a027-42ab-b1c6-6545f308bd42-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/27/us/27xp-homicide-1-print/merlin_151287327_910379bc-a027-42ab-b1c6-6545f308bd42-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo