on reflects a tension between social conservatives and supporters of Ms. Rao more concerned with delivering on the president’s deregulatory policies.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/02/26/us/politics/josh-hawley-neomi-rao-abortion.html', 'snippet': 'The concern over Ms. Rao’s judicial nomination reflects a tension between social conservatives and supporters of Ms. Rao more concerned with delivering on the president’s deregulatory policies.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Neomi Rao seemed like the ideal replacement for Brett M. Kavanaugh on the United States Court of Appeals for the District of Columbia Circuit when President Trump nominated her to take his place after he ascended to the Supreme Court.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/26/us/politics/26dc-judge/merlin_150224184_eb6c4acb-7e7a-4018-930a-d06b5726e87b-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/02/26/us/politics/26dc-judge/merlin_150224184_eb6c4acb-7e7a-4018-930a-d06b5726e87b-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/26/us/politics/26dc-judge/merlin_150224184_eb6c4acb-7e7a-4018-930a-d06b5726e87b-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/26/us/politics/26dc-judge/merlin_150224184_eb6c4acb-7e7a-4018-930a-d06b5726e87b-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/26/us/politics/26dc-judg