nges its audience’s willingness to make believe.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/02/26/theater/alice-by-heart-review.html', 'snippet': 'This directionless new musical, set in Lewis Carroll’s Wonderland and a London subway station, challenges its audience’s willingness to make believe.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Fantasy in the face of faith-testing adversity is the subject of the new musical “Alice by Heart,” the inaugural production of the Robert W. Wilson MCC Theater Space in Hell’s Kitchen. So perhaps it’s appropriate that audiences for this thickly layered riff on Lewis Carroll’s much-plundered Wonderland novel, which opened on Tuesday night, should find their own will to make believe so relentlessly challenged.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/27/arts/27alice/merlin_150228132_2a35a4a3-52d1-4c16-b960-e1b44734f0f3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 391, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/02/27/arts/27alice/merlin_150228132_2a35a4a3-52d1-4c16-b960-e1b44734f0f3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 391}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/27/arts/27alice/merlin_150228132_2a35a4a3-52d1-4c16-b960-e1b44734f0f3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 667, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/27/arts/27alice/merlin_150228132_2a35a4a3-52d1-4c16-b960-e1b44734f0f3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1333, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/27/arts/27alice/27alice-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, '