9183120a7f'}, {'abstract': 'A search operation was underway for the British climber Tom Ballard and his Italian counterpart on Nanga Parbat.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/02/28/world/asia/uk-climber-nanga-parbat-mountain.html', 'snippet': 'A search operation was underway for the British climber Tom Ballard and his Italian counterpart on Nanga Parbat.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A British climber whose mother was the first woman to reach the peak of Mount Everest in a solo climb has disappeared with his Italian counterpart while climbing Nanga Parbat in Pakistan, the ninth-highest mountain in the world.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/03/01/world/01UK-climber-print/fileupload-1551358880704-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/03/01/world/01UK-climber-print/fileupload-1551358880704-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/03/01/world/01UK-climber-print/fileupload-1551358880704-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 750, 'width': 1000, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/03/01/world/01UK-climber-print/fileupload-1551358880704-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 750, 'width': 1000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/03/01/world/01UK-climber-print/21UK-climber2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/03/01/world/01UK-climber-print/21UK-climber2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/03/01/world/01UK-climber-print/21UK-climber2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Climber Whose Mother Conquered Everest Solo Disappears on Pakistan’s ‘Killer Mountain’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Two Climbers Disappear On Mountain in Pakistan', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mountaineering', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mountains', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hargreaves, Alison (1962-95)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ALPS MOUNTAINS', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Nanga Parbat (Pakistan)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Pakistan', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'K2 (Himalayas)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-02-28T14:27:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Iliana Magra', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Iliana', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Magra', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9df5f539-6af8-5d48-b4a5-e1025ee277ce', 'word_count': 587, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9df5f539-6af8-5d48-b4a5-e1025ee277ce'}, {'abstract': 'In a city of renters, homeownership remains a dream for most.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/02/28/realestate/slicing-new-yorks-housing-pie.html', 'snippet': 'In a city of renters, homeownership remains a dream for most.', 'lead_paragraph': 'New York is a city of renters. Of its total housing stock